09","parts":["贝","⺈","厂","八","言"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3554"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"subvenir aux besoins de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"subvenir aux besoins de ; abondant"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"伤":{"c":"伤","pinyin":"shāng","lectures":["shāng"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","𠂉","力"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0610","L3-0611","L3-0676","L4-0618","L5-0020","L6-0709","L6-0710","L6-0711","L7-0597","L7-3555","L7-3556","L7-3557","L7-3558","L7-3559","L7-3970","L7-5433"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"blesser ; blessure","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"blesser, se blesser ; nuire à"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"blessure"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他的腿受伤了。","pinyin":"Tā de tuǐ shòushāng le.","fr":"Il s'est fait mal à la jambe.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"他的伤不重。","pinyin":"Tā de shāng bù zhòng.","fr":"Il n'est pas gravement touché.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"商":{"c":"商","pinyin":"shāng","lectures":["shāng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亠","丷","冂","八","口"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0313","L1-0314","L2-0470","L2-0471","L3-0612","L3-0613","L4-0619","L5-0647","L6-0107","L6-0319","L6-0712","L6-0895","L7-0667","L7-1338","L7-2182","L7-2334","L7-3560","L7-3561","L7-3562","L7-5404"],"chemin":{"hsk":146,"lire":181},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"commerce, commerçant, discuter","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"商 nomme déjà la dynastie Shang sur les os oraculaires, mais ce que dessinait la forme reste discuté. Pour s'en souvenir : sous un toit, 亠 et 丷, un étal fermé, 冂, où 八 et 口 figurent une bouche qui marchande. Le sens le plus courant aujourd'hui est « commerce, marchand », et 商 veut aussi dire « se concerter ».","en":"商 already names the Shang dynasty on oracle bones, but what the form once depicted is still debated. To remember it: under a roof, 亠 and 丷, a closed stall, 冂, where 八 and 口 make a mouth haggling over prices. Today its commonest meaning is “trade, merchant”, and 商 also means “to consult”.","roles":{"亠":"forme","丷":"forme","冂":"forme","八":"forme","口":"forme"}}},"赏":{"c":"赏","pinyin":"shǎng","lectures":["shǎng"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺌","冖","口","贝"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0620","L4-0926","L5-0848","L7-1457","L7-2024"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"récompenser ; admirer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"récompenser, donner une récompense"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"admirer, apprécier"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我们去公园赏花吧。","pinyin":"Wǒmen qù gōngyuán shǎng huā ba.","fr":"Allons regarder les fleurs au parc.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"上":{"c":"上","pinyin":"shàng","lectures":["shàng","shǎng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L1-0044","L1-0072","L1-0126","L1-0219","L1-0223","L1-0226","L1-0315","L1-0316","L1-0317","L1-0318","L1-0319","L1-0320","L1-0321","L1-0322","L1-0323","L1-0326","L1-0374","L1-0375","L1-0459","L2-0472","L2-0533","L2-0655","L3-0315","L3-0412","L3-0614","L3-0615","L3-0616","L3-0617","L3-0618","L3-0644","L3-0659","L4-0113","L4-0621","L4-0622","L4-0623","L4-0695","L5-0003","L5-0366","L5-0648","L5-0649","L5-0650","L5-0832","L6-0050","L6-0298","L6-0300","L6-0713","L6-0714","L6-0715","L6-0716","L6-0717","L6-0953","L7-0161","L7-0294","L7-0450","L7-0472","L7-0714","L7-1328","L7-1329","L7-1426","L7-1777","L7-3092","L7-3563","L7-3564","L7-3565","L7-3566","L7-3567","L7-3568","L7-3569","L7-3570","L7-3571","L7-3572","L7-3573","L7-3574","L7-3575","L7-3576","L7-3577","L7-3578","L7-3579","L7-3580","L7-3581","L7-3887","L7-3983","L7-3999","L7-4735","L7-5124","L7-5582"],"chemin":{"hsk":60,"lire":58},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"en haut, sur, monter","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"书在桌子上。","pinyin":"Shū zài zhuōzi shang.","fr":"Le livre est sur la table.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"他上楼了。","pinyin":"Tā shàng lóu le.","fr":"Il est monté à l'étage.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 上 s'écrit d'un court trait placé au-dessus d'un trait plus long, qui sert de repère. Le Shuowen jiezi le range parmi les caractères qui désignent une idée par un signe plutôt que par le dessin d'un objet. Son contraire 下 suit la même logique, avec le petit trait sous le repère.","en":"On oracle bones, 上 is written as a short stroke above a longer one that serves as a reference line. The Shuowen jiezi classes it among characters that point to an idea with a sign rather than draw an object. Its opposite, 下, works the same way, with the short stroke below the line.","roles":{}}},"尚":{"c":"尚","pinyin":"shàng","lectures":["shàng"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺌","⺆","口"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0266","L7-0507","L7-1161","L7-1626","L7-3582","L7-3583","L7-3705"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"encore (écrit)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"encore, toujours : langue écrite"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这件事尚不清楚。","pinyin":"Zhè jiàn shì shàng bù qīngchu.","fr":"Cette affaire n'est pas encore éclaircie.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"捎":{"c":"捎","pinyin":"shāo","lectures":["shāo","shào"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","⺌","月"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3584"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"apporter en passant, transmettre","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"apporter en passant, transmettre (un message, un objet)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你去超市的时候，帮我捎瓶水。","pinyin":"Nǐ qù chāoshì de shíhou, bāng wǒ shāo píng shuǐ.","fr":"Quand tu vas au supermarché, rapporte-moi une bouteille d'eau.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"梢":{"c":"梢","pinyin":"shāo","lectures":["shāo","sào"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","⺌","月"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3827"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"bout, extrémité","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"bout, extrémité (branche, cheveux)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"烧":{"c":"烧","pinyin":"shāo","lectures":["shāo"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["火","𭠍","兀"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L4-0221","L4-0599","L4-0624","L7-1131","L7-3585","L7-3586"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"brûler ; cuire ; chauffer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"brûler"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"cuire, faire chauffer, faire bouillir"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"avoir de la fièvre"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我给你烧点儿水。","pinyin":"Wǒ gěi nǐ shāo diǎnr shuǐ.","fr":"Je vais te faire bouillir de l'eau.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"稍":{"c":"稍","pinyin":"shāo","lectures":["shāo","shào"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["禾","⺌","月"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0651","L5-0652","L7-3587","L7-3588","L7-3589"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"un peu, légèrement","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"un peu, légèrement"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"请稍等一下。","pinyin":"Qǐng shāo děng yīxià.","fr":"Patientez un instant, s'il vous plaît.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"勺":{"c":"勺","pinyin":"sháo","lectures":["sháo"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L6-0718"],"chemin":{"hsk":197,"lire":166},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"cuillère, louche","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他用勺喝汤。","pinyin":"Tā yòng sháo hē tāng.","fr":"Il boit sa soupe à la cuillère.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi définit 勺 comme ce qui sert à puiser, et le décrit comme une louche avec quelque chose dedans. On y voit 勹 qui enveloppe un point : la cuillère et ce qu'elle contient. À droite de 的, il a donné autrefois le son, que la lecture actuelle ne laisse plus entendre.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi defines 勺 as something to ladle with, and describes it as a ladle with something inside. One can see 勹 wrapping a dot: the spoon and what it holds. On the right of 的 it once gave the sound, which today's reading no longer lets you hear.","roles":{}}},"少":{"c":"少","pinyin":"shǎo","lectures":["shǎo","shào"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L1-0095","L1-0324","L2-0040","L2-0438","L2-0473","L2-0474","L3-0579","L3-0920","L4-0380","L6-0719","L7-0166","L7-1838","L7-1882","L7-3590","L7-3591","L7-3592","L7-3593","L7-3594","L7-3595","L7-4419"],"chemin":{"hsk":46,"lire":45},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"peu, manquer, jeune","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这里人很少。","pinyin":"Zhèli rén hěn shǎo.","fr":"Il y a peu de monde ici.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"你少喝点儿茶。","pinyin":"Nǐ shǎo hē diǎnr chá.","fr":"Bois un peu moins de thé.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 少 s'écrit de quatre petits points, là où 小 en compte trois : les deux caractères notaient des mots très proches, « petit » et « peu ». Le Shuowen jiezi rattache 少 à 小, avec le sens « pas nombreux ». Dans la forme actuelle, 少 est 小 prolongé d'un trait oblique qui descend vers la gauche.","en":"On oracle bones, 少 is written with four small dots where 小 has three: the two wrote closely related words, “small” and “few”. The Shuowen jiezi links 少 to 小, with the meaning “not many”. In the current form, 少 is 小 with an extra slanting stroke sweeping down to the left.","roles":{}}},"哨":{"c":"哨","pinyin":"shào","lectures":["shào"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","⺌","月"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2430"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"sifflet ; poste de garde","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"sifflet"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"poste de garde, sentinelle"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"裁判吹响了哨子。","pinyin":"Cáipàn chuī xiǎng le shàozi.","fr":"L'arbitre a donné un coup de sifflet.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"绍":{"c":"绍","pinyin":"shào","lectures":["shào"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["纟","刀","口"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0179"],"chemin":{"hsk":140},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"relier, prolonger","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"relier, prolonger ; présenter, dans jièshào"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 紹 par « continuer » : le fil, 糸, et 召 pour le son. Un fil qu'on noue au bout d'un autre, c'est ce qui continue et relie. Simplifié, 糸 devient 纟 ; 召, écrit 刀 sur 口, se lit zhào et ne donne plus le son de shào.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 紹 as “to continue”: thread, 糸, and 召 for the sound. A thread tied to the end of another is what carries on and connects. Simplified, 糸 becomes 纟; 召, written 刀 over 口, is read zhào and no longer gives the sound of shào.","roles":{"纟":"sens","刀":"forme","口":"forme"}}},"奢":{"c":"奢","pinyin":"shē","lectures":["shē"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["大","耂","日"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3596","L7-3597"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"luxueux ; excessif","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"luxueux, dispendieux ; excessif"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"舌":{"c":"舌","pinyin":"shé","lectures":["shé"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L6-0720","L7-3178"],"chemin":{"hsk":188,"lire":113},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"langue (organe)","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 舌 dessine une langue fourchue qui sort d'une bouche 口, parfois entourée de gouttes de salive. Le Shuowen jiezi le définit comme ce qui, dans la bouche, sert à parler et à distinguer les saveurs. Dans 话 et 活, pourtant, 舌 a remplacé dans l'écriture une autre forme ancienne qui lui ressemblait : la langue n'y est pour rien.","en":"On oracle bones, 舌 draws a forked tongue coming out of a mouth 口, sometimes with drops of saliva around it. The Shuowen jiezi defines it as the part of the mouth used to speak and to tell flavours apart. In 话 and 活, however, 舌 took the place of another old shape that looked like it: the tongue has nothing to do with them.","roles":{}}},"蛇":{"c":"蛇","pinyin":"shé","lectures":["shé","yí"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["虫","宀","匕"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0653","L7-1734"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"serpent","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"serpent"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我最怕蛇。","pinyin":"Wǒ zuì pà shé.","fr":"Ce que je crains le plus, ce sont les serpents.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"舍":{"c":"舍","pinyin":"shě","lectures":["shě","shè"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["人","干","口"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0654","L5-0655","L5-0728","L7-2616","L7-4876"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"renoncer, se séparer de ; logis","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"abandonner, renoncer à, se séparer de"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"maison, logis ; dortoir","pinyin":"shè"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他住在学校宿舍。","pinyin":"Tā zhù zài xuéxiào sùshè.","fr":"Il loge à la résidence universitaire.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"射":{"c":"射","pinyin":"shè","lectures":["shè"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["身","寸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0226","L5-0659","L5-0660","L5-1041","L7-1192","L7-4160","L7-5288"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"tirer, lancer ; projeter","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"tirer (une flèche, une balle), lancer"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"projeter, émettre (lumière, eau)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"阳光射进了房间。","pinyin":"Yángguāng shè jìn le fángjiān.","fr":"Le soleil entre dans la pièce.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"慑":{"c":"慑","pinyin":"shè","lectures":["shè"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["忄","耳","又","又"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"